{"title":"Amy Sherald and Michelle Obama","link":"https://kottke.org/25/02/amy-sherald-and-michelle-obama","date":1740173558000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/obama-sherald.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/obama-sherald.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/obama-sherald.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1951\" alt=\"artist Amy Sherald and former First Lady Michelle Obama\" /></p>\n\n<p>I don’t think I’ve ever seen <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DGBuhPTxfV5/\">this photo</a> before, of artist <a href=\"https://www.hauserwirth.com/artists/11577-amy-sherald/\">Amy Sherald</a> and former First Lady Michelle Obama sharing a hug during a session for <a href=\"https://npg.si.edu/learn/classroom-resource/michelle-obama\">Sherald’s iconic portrait of Obama</a>. What a different time that was, huh?</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Amy%20Sherald\">Amy Sherald</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Michelle%20Obama\">Michelle Obama</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/02/amy-sherald-and-michelle-obama\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"fe54e6daa5989b9467f14ab7bbed08758874e15a7ab725fc8d47c43b09714ff8","category":"Sites"}